Keys · Sessions ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

 Sessions
  pgup/pgdn              page
  home/g, end            first, last row
  enter                  go into the selected session on NAME, or open the
                         delegation policy on DELEGATE
  m                      send a message to the session as yourself
  n                      start a session in herdr: project, harness, model,
                         folder and first message (a form)
  x                      stop the selected worker or session
  h                      hide or unhide the selected session
  left, right            move between NAME, RULE and DELEGATE cells
  space                  cycle the request rule: normal, ask, auto
  v                      cycle the view: active only, all, all with offline, all
                         with offline and hidden
  d                      show or hide the selected session details

 Global keys
  1-7                    switch tabs: Sessions, Graph, Quotas, Messages, Tools,
                         Settings, Inbox
  enter                  go into the selected thing
  more below
up/down scroll  ? all screens  esc close
